{"seq":1,"slug":"availability-calendar-booking-hold-engine","title":"可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎：时段建模、占位 TTL 与超卖防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/booking-pricing-deposit-risk/availability-calendar-booking-hold-engine","wordCount":2853,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎-时段建模-占位-ttl-与超卖防护\">可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎：时段建模、占位 TTL 与超卖防护</h1><p>当两个买家在同一个毫秒点下「租赁 3 月 1–7 日」时，被竞争的不是一件商品，而是「这台资产在某区间上的独占使用权」。零售卖永久所有权、库存是整数；租赁卖时间片、库存是时间轴上的容量约束。这类资产统称序列化资产（serialized asset），注册与唯一标识见<a href=\"../rental-model-serialized-asset-registry/\">序列化资产注册表</a>。本文只回答：如何判定时段是否还空着，并在付款前安全占住，既不放走成交也不超卖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可用性是时间轴上的容量约束\">核心概念：可用性是时间轴上的容量约束</h2><p>对一个资产或资产池，可用性不是布尔值，而是定义在时间轴上的容量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 能被同时租出的最大份数。一次预订占用半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s, e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，任意时刻都必须满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>active</mtext></msub></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≤</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\forall t,\\quad \\sum_{b \\in B_{\\text{active}}} \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\,s_b \\le t &lt; e_b\\,\\big] \\;\\le\\; C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4522em;vertical-align:-1.4022em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4022em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超卖（overbooking）即该不等式被违反；所有并发算法的目标，都是把「检查该不等式」和「写入新占用」变成原子的。可用性有三种建模方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>代表场景</th>\n<th>资源标识</th>\n<th>冲突判定</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元日历 unit calendar</td>\n<td>单反相机、独栋民宿、工程机械</td>\n<td>具体资产 ID</td>\n<td>同一资产区间重叠即冲突</td>\n<td>最严，扩展性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>池化配额 pooled quota</td>\n<td>共享充电宝、酒店标准间、替换件</td>\n<td>SKU 池 ID</td>\n<td>区间内占用计数 ≤ 池容量</td>\n<td>松，需处理「承诺 A 交付 B」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合 hybrid</td>\n<td>带型号偏好的租车</td>\n<td>车型池 + 具体车</td>\n<td>先按池判定，再指派单元</td>\n<td>灵活，指派仍需二次校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪种模型，写入占用前都需要一条不可绕过的「冲突检查 + 落库」原子路径。下图是一次预订的生命周期；关键决策是<strong>占位（hold）与确认（confirm）分离</strong>：结账页停留、支付往返、3DS 挑战可能耗时数十秒到数分钟，从点击就写死区间会让犹豫买家锁死库存，完全不占则付款后才发现时段被抢走——占位给请求一个有时限的临时独占权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[买家提交预订请求&lt;br/&gt;资产/池 + 时间区间] --&gt; B[幂等键去重]&#10;  B --&gt; C{可用性校验&lt;br/&gt;区间容量是否足够}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| X[返回不可用/推荐邻近时段]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[创建占位 hold&lt;br/&gt;状态 HELD + TTL]&#10;  D --&gt; E[并发写入防重叠&lt;br/&gt;唯一约束/行锁]&#10;  E --&gt;|约束冲突| X&#10;  E --&gt;|成功| F[发起支付/押金授权]&#10;  F --&gt;|授权成功| G[状态 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;写死区间]&#10;  F --&gt;|超时/失败| H[TTL 到期 → EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;释放时段]&#10;  G --&gt; J[履约与归还&lt;br/&gt;见履约篇]\">graph TD\n  A[买家提交预订请求&lt;br/&gt;资产/池 + 时间区间] --&gt; B[幂等键去重]\n  B --&gt; C{可用性校验&lt;br/&gt;区间容量是否足够}\n  C --&gt;|否| X[返回不可用/推荐邻近时段]\n  C --&gt;|是| D[创建占位 hold&lt;br/&gt;状态 HELD + TTL]\n  D --&gt; E[并发写入防重叠&lt;br/&gt;唯一约束/行锁]\n  E --&gt;|约束冲突| X\n  E --&gt;|成功| F[发起支付/押金授权]\n  F --&gt;|授权成功| G[状态 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;写死区间]\n  F --&gt;|超时/失败| H[TTL 到期 → EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;释放时段]\n  G --&gt; J[履约与归还&lt;br/&gt;见履约篇]</pre><h2 id=\"时段数据模型-半开区间-粒度与时区\">时段数据模型：半开区间、粒度与时区</h2><p>第一个约定是区间开闭性：整条链路统一采用<strong>半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s, e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，起点含、终点不含。「3 月 1–7 日」与「3 月 7–14 日」因此在 3 月 7 日零点无缝衔接而不重叠，消除绝大多数边界判定 bug；该约定与 iCalendar 标准（RFC 5545，<code>DTEND</code> 为不含端点的排他值）一致。第二个是<strong>粒度（granularity）</strong>：租车按「天 + 取还时刻」，设备按小时，场地按半小时——粒度过细会让约束索引膨胀、查询变慢，过粗无法表达「上午有人、下午空出」；常见做法是存原始连续区间、另维护按粒度对齐的物化视图。第三个是<strong>时区与夏令时</strong>：区间以 UTC 存储，同时保留资产本地时区，因为「每天 09:00 取车」是本地墙钟语义；夏令时切换日会造成 23 或 25 小时的一天，按「天数 × 24 小时」算会错位一小时（RFC 5545 用 <code>VTIMEZONE</code> 承载该语义）。第四个是<strong>周转缓冲（turnaround buffer）</strong>——归还到再次可租之间需要清洁、校准、充电，不可售；它不应硬编码，而应作为资产属性在写入占用时对区间做「膨胀」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>prep</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>prep</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s,e) \\;\\rightarrow\\; [\\,s - \\text{prep},\\; e + \\text{prep}\\,)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prep</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prep</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>于是「12:00 归还、12:00 即可再租」被显式建模为「实际不可用区间比物理占用更长」，冲突判定自动覆盖缓冲。占用区间字段用 PostgreSQL 的 <code>tstzrange</code> 承载（原生表达带时区半开区间，是后续排他约束的基础），表至少需要资产/池 ID、状态、区间、<code>hold_expires</code>、幂等键与乐观锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占位状态机与-ttl-让临时独占不变成永久锁\">占位状态机与 TTL：让临时独占不变成永久锁</h2><p>占位的本质是「有超时的租约（lease）」，状态转移是一条有限状态机，每态有明确进入条件与出口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>进入条件</th>\n<th>出口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>HELD</code></td>\n<td>临时占位</td>\n<td>校验通过且写入成功</td>\n<td>支付成功 → CONFIRMED；超时 → EXPIRED；取消 → RELEASED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CONFIRMED</code></td>\n<td>占用写死</td>\n<td>支付/押金授权成功</td>\n<td>履约完成 → FULFILLED；违约 → 走逆向流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EXPIRED</code></td>\n<td>超时释放</td>\n<td>TTL 到期且未支付</td>\n<td>终态（时段可被再次占用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RELEASED</code></td>\n<td>主动放弃</td>\n<td>买家取消或校验失败</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FULFILLED</code></td>\n<td>已履约</td>\n<td>交付并归还闭环</td>\n<td>终态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TTL 是纯粹的体验—转化权衡：太短，买家在支付通道慢时被踢出且库存抖动；太长，热门资产被少数犹豫买家锁住数小时，损耗可租率。行业实践通常落在 5–20 分钟并对高需求资产收紧；更稳妥的是<strong>滑动续期</strong>——结账页有真实交互时续一小段。关键工程点：<strong>释放绝不能依赖「有计划地跑定时任务」</strong>——进程崩溃、部署重启、时钟漂移都会让它漏跑，把时段幽灵占死；正确做法是把有效性定义为查询时求值，一笔 <code>HELD</code> 只在 <code>now() &lt; hold_expires</code> 时才算占用，释放任务退化为后台回收。占位还需与<strong>支付授权</strong>联动：卡支付中授权（authorization，冻结额度）与请款（capture，实际扣款）分离，Stripe 的 capture-later 文档指出未请款的授权约 7 天后失效（stripe.com/docs/payments/capture-later；Adyen 同类机制见 docs.adyen.com/online-payments/capture）。押金（deposit）本身是一笔延后请款的授权，用于覆盖损坏与逾期，因此占位 TTL 必须短于支付授权有效期，否则会「占位还在、授权已失效、请款失败」。Visa 等卡组织对住宿、租车等商户类别允许更长授权有效期（部分场景可达 30 天），并通过增量授权在取车/入住时补足金额——这是押金授权模型的基础。判定「hold 是否仍占用某时刻」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mtext>status</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>CONFIRMED</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>status</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>HELD</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>hold_expires</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t) = \\big[\\,s \\le t &lt; e\\,\\big] \\;\\wedge\\; \\Big(\\text{status} = \\text{CONFIRMED} \\;\\vee\\; \\big(\\text{status} = \\text{HELD} \\;\\wedge\\; t &lt; \\text{hold\\_expires}\\big)\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CONFIRMED</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HELD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hold_expires</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"并发控制与超卖防护-把检查与写入变成原子\">并发控制与超卖防护：把检查与写入变成原子</h2><p>这是全篇的核心：只要「查冲突」和「写占用」之间存在时间窗口就会超卖。三种防线按强度递进。<strong>第一防线：数据库排他约束（最强、最该先上）。</strong> PostgreSQL 的排他约束（exclusion constraint）用 GiST 索引表达「同一资产、区间不重叠」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"ALTER TABLE booking ADD CONSTRAINT booking_no_overlap&#10;  EXCLUDE USING gist (asset_id WITH =, period WITH &amp;&amp;)&#10;  WHERE (status IN (&#39;HELD&#39;,&#39;CONFIRMED&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> booking </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> booking_no_overlap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  EXCLUDE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist (asset_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26;)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HELD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&amp;&amp;</code> 是区间重叠运算符；违反约束的插入会被数据库在提交时拒绝，超卖在存储层被物理杜绝（postgresql.org/docs/current/ddl-constraints.html#DDL-CONSTRAINTS-EXCLUSION）。两点注意：<code>asset_id WITH =</code> 需要 <code>btree_gist</code> 扩展；<code>WHERE</code> 是<strong>部分索引</strong>，让 <code>EXPIRED</code>/<code>RELEASED</code> 的历史行不参与冲突，无需物理删除即可释放时段。池化配额模型无法用区间约束表达，改用「容量表 + 行锁扣减」。<strong>第二防线：行级锁与乐观锁。</strong> 约束无法表达或需先读后判时，用数据库锁把临界区串行化：悲观做法 <code>SELECT ... FOR UPDATE</code> 锁住相关行，高并发下用 <code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 跳过已锁候选行，适合「从可用池里抢一个」（postgresql.org/docs/current/explicit-locking.html）；乐观做法给行加 <code>version</code>，<code>UPDATE ... WHERE version = ?</code> 失败即重试，冲突率低时吞吐更好，冲突高时会活锁需退避。</p>\n<p><strong>第三防线：分布式原子操作与幂等。</strong> 多实例部署时跨进程互斥不能只靠单库锁。Redis 的 <code>SET key value NX PX ttl</code> 可实现「带超时的锁」，但 Redlock 在时钟漂移与 GC 停顿下的正确性存在公开争议，不应作为唯一正确性来源——它适合做快速失败的前置限流，正确性仍由数据库约束兜底。预订接口还必须<strong>幂等</strong>：客户端网络重试会重复提交，不去重就产生两条占用；IETF 的 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 请求头草案（datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-httpapi-idempotency-key-header/）以幂等键为唯一索引，重复请求返回首次结果。</p>\n<p>综合路径：Redis 热点准入限流 → 事务内插入 <code>HELD</code> 行 → 排他约束在提交时兜底拒绝重叠 → 冲突返回不可用或推荐邻近时段 → 成功返回 hold 凭据。约束冲突应被当作<strong>正常控制流</strong>而非异常，返回可读的「该时段刚被占用」页面而非 500。hold 池容量用利特尔法则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 估算：热门品类每秒 20 个预订、平均存活 8 分钟，稳态约 9600 个活跃 hold——这个量级决定索引设计（部分索引的 <code>WHERE</code> 谓词要能走索引）与清理任务批大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日历同步与外部渠道冲突\">日历同步与外部渠道冲突</h2><p>租赁库存往往同时暴露在自有站点和第三方渠道（OTA、预订平台、企业 B2B 门户）。每个渠道都有一份「它认为的」日历副本，同步延迟就会制造冲突：A 渠道刚卖掉 3 月 5 日，B 渠道的副本还没更新，于是 B 也卖了出去——这是<strong>跨系统超卖</strong>，单库排他约束防不住。标准化交换格式是 iCalendar（RFC 5545）及其扩展 RFC 7986，配合 CalDAV（RFC 4791），核心对象是 <code>VEVENT</code>（一件事）与 <code>FREEBUSY</code>（忙闲时间）。四条设计原则：<strong>单一真相源</strong>——自有占用库是唯一权威，渠道下单必须调自有预订 API，绝不反向写日历；<strong>只推「不可用区间（黑名单）而非可售区间」</strong>——漏推一个可售时段只损失一单，漏推一个不可用时段会超卖；<strong>同步延迟量化并留安全边际</strong>——渠道窗口 2 分钟就把黑名单末端多留一小段；<strong>对账兜底</strong>——定期比对各渠道日历与自有占用，分歧以自有为准并补偿。映射上，单次占用 ↔ <code>VEVENT</code>，忙闲块 ↔ <code>FREEBUSY</code>，周转缓冲需独立 <code>VEVENT</code> 或负向 <code>FREEBUSY</code>；三者只<strong>出</strong>，渠道订单只<strong>入</strong>经预订 API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>租赁库存的正确抽象是<strong>时间轴上的容量约束</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\mathbb{1}[s \\le t &lt; e] \\le C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；不要退化成整数库存扣减，并用<strong>半开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s,e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 与 UTC 存储 + 本地时区语义、区间膨胀显式建模周转缓冲。</li>\n<li><strong>占位（hold）是带 TTL 的租约</strong>：<code>HELD → CONFIRMED/EXPIRED/RELEASED</code>，有效性在查询时求值（<code>now() &lt; hold_expires</code>），释放任务只做后台回收；TTL 必须<strong>短于支付授权有效期</strong>（押金是延后请款的授权，与卡组织授权时长含增量授权强耦合）。</li>\n<li>防超卖按强度分层：<strong>PostgreSQL 排他约束（<code>EXCLUDE USING gist</code>）是存储层物理兜底</strong>，行锁/乐观锁处理池计数与先读后判，Redis 锁仅作前置限流，接口必须幂等。</li>\n<li>跨渠道冲突靠<strong>单一真相源 + 只推不可用区间 + 量化同步延迟 + 定期对账</strong>，日历只作下游投影；用利特尔法则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 估算活跃 hold 规模。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>时段建模做对之后，下一步是把「这一刻值多少钱」变成可计算的分时定价与押金策略，并让风险控制贯穿预订全流程——这是本仓「预订、分时定价、押金与风险控制」章节后续篇目的主题。占用一旦确认，资产就从「可售」进入「已租」，交付、归还、检测与再上架由<a href=\"../fulfillment-reverse-asset-lifecycle/\">履约与逆向资产生命周期</a>承接。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎：时段建模、占位 TTL 与超卖防护","id":"可用性日历与预约占位并发引擎-时段建模-占位-ttl-与超卖防护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可用性是时间轴上的容量约束","id":"核心概念-可用性是时间轴上的容量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"时段数据模型：半开区间、粒度与时区","id":"时段数据模型-半开区间-粒度与时区"},{"level":2,"text":"占位状态机与 TTL：让临时独占不变成永久锁","id":"占位状态机与-ttl-让临时独占不变成永久锁"},{"level":2,"text":"并发控制与超卖防护：把检查与写入变成原子","id":"并发控制与超卖防护-把检查与写入变成原子"},{"level":2,"text":"日历同步与外部渠道冲突","id":"日历同步与外部渠道冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"资产可用状态机与可租赁单元层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/rental-model-serialized-asset-registry/asset-availability-state-machine-lifecycle-unit"},"next":{"title":"分时阶梯定价与押金授权模型：从边际价格折扣到可撤销的押金冻结","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/rental-access-commerce-reservation-inventory-asset-lifecycle/booking-pricing-deposit-risk/duration-tiered-pricing-deposit-authorization"}}